{
  "id": "474",
  "title": "When Will the Product Plan be Done?",
  "level": "intermediate",
  "date": "2018-03-11",
  "synopsis": "Manager Wang wants to speed up the plans for the new product.",
  "audioUrl": "https://static.duchinese.net/documents/673/39a04a58c28dfa417db8267a5867e5ffa73d9a20.mp3?1698351657",
  "series": null,
  "fullText": {
    "simplified": "最晚什么时候能完成？\n\n王经理：小何，新产品的设计最晚什么时候能完成？\n小何：两周之内吧。\n王经理：能加快点吗？太晚会影响生产进度。\n小何：我尽量吧。\n王经理：这样吧。我让小张来帮你。你们俩这几天辛苦些，加点班，一周内把设计做出来。\n小何：好的。",
    "traditional": "最晚什麼時候能完成？\n\n王經理：小何，新產品的設計最晚什麼時候能完成？\n小何：兩週之內吧。\n王經理：能加快點嗎？太晚會影響生產進度。\n小何：我儘量吧。\n王經理：這樣吧。我讓小張來幫你。你們倆這幾天辛苦些，加點班，一週內把設計做出來。\n小何：好的。"
  },
  "sentences": [
    {
      "index": 1,
      "simplified": "\n\n",
      "traditional": "\n\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "When will it be done at the latest?"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "simplified": "王经理：小何，新产品的设计最晚什么时候能完成？",
      "traditional": "王經理：小何，新產品的設計最晚什麼時候能完成？",
      "pinyin": "wáng jīng lǐ xiǎo hé xīn chǎn pǐn de shè jì zuì wǎn shén me shí hou néng wán chéng",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Manager Wang: Little He, when will the new product plan be finished at the latest?"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "simplified": "小何：两周之内吧。",
      "traditional": "小何：兩週之內吧。",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo hé liǎng zhōu zhī nèi ba",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little He: Within two weeks."
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "simplified": "王经理：能加快点吗？太晚会影响生产进度。",
      "traditional": "王經理：能加快點嗎？太晚會影響生產進度。",
      "pinyin": "wáng jīng lǐ néng jiā kuài diǎn ma tài wǎn huì yǐng xiǎng shēng chǎn jìn dù",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Manager Wang: Can it be sped up a bit? If it's too late it could affect the manufacturing schedule."
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "simplified": "小何：我尽量吧。",
      "traditional": "小何：我儘量吧。",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo hé wǒ jǐn liàng ba",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little He: I'll do my best."
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "simplified": "王经理：这样吧。我让小张来帮你。",
      "traditional": "王經理：這樣吧。我讓小張來幫你。",
      "pinyin": "wáng jīng lǐ zhè yàng ba wǒ ràng xiǎo zhāng lái bāng nǐ",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "simplified": "你们俩这几天辛苦些，加点班，一周内把设计做出来。",
      "traditional": "你們倆這幾天辛苦些，加點班，一週內把設計做出來。",
      "pinyin": "nǐ men liǎ zhè jǐ tiān xīn kǔ xiē jiā diǎn bān yì zhōu nèi bǎ shè jì zuò chū lái",
      "english": "Manager Wang: How about this. I'll have Little Zhang help you."
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "The two of you can work a bit of overtime the coming few days, and finish the plan within one week."
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "simplified": "小何：好的。",
      "traditional": "小何：好的。",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo hé hǎo de",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "simplified": "",
      "traditional": "",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little He: Sure."
    }
  ],
