      "When will it be done at the latest?",
      "",
      "Manager Wang: Little He, when will the new product plan be finished at the latest?",
      "",
      "Little He: Within two weeks.",
      "",
      "Manager Wang: Can it be sped up a bit? If it's too late it could affect the manufacturing schedule.",
      "",
      "Little He: I'll do my best.",
      "",
